<title>JAPAN: ShinMaywa - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>ShinMaywa - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 52.35		vs	   52.69</p>
<p> Operating	  995    million    vs	  879    million</p>
<p> Current		1.18		vs	    1.41</p>
